     "text": "Photosynthesis is _the process by which plants synthesise carbohydrates from raw materials using energy from light_. Learn that definition word for word, and with it the word equation: _carbon dioxide + water → glucose + oxygen, in the presence of light and chlorophyll_. The conditions are marked separately from the reactants and the products, so write them every time.",
