   "golden": "Fertilisation is the FUSION of a pollen nucleus with a nucleus in an ovule. Pollination only transfers the pollen to the stigma. Nothing is fertilised on the stigma, so \"the pollen fertilises the stigma\" is wrong: fertilisation happens later, inside an ovule.",
